    <string name="confirm_local">All recordings, projects, presets, profiles and settings on this device will be deleted. This cannot be undone.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">• Audio you record or import is processed on your device.\n• Nothing is uploaded unless you explicitly start a cloud action and accept the upload notice.\n• The microphone is used only while you press Record or Live; there is no hidden or background recording.\n• Voice cloning requires your explicit consent and may only be used with voices you own or have permission to use.\n• Converted cloud audio is labeled as AI-generated.\n• Your access token is stored encrypted on this device.\n• You can delete voice samples, profiles, server data and all local data in Settings.\n• Payment details are never stored by this app.</string>

